      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUPER FINE (3) has a strong record this track and trip with two wins and two placings from five starts. Below best last time at Dubbo (23.67) in a Mix, finishing a 12 length sixth. Looks the one to beat with even luck. GRAPEFRUIT YAEKO (1) stalked the lead from a middle draw and boxed on well to finish 0.8 lengths back in third (30.71) at this track in a Grade 5 over 525m. Expected to feature. MINI AURORA (2) finds it hard to break through. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing third (23.49) at Dubbo. Expected to feature again. TELL ME SECRET'S (7) is in the mix after placing at a big quote last time out.",
